# DIEM DANH BV87 — CURSOR RULES

## 1. LANGUAGE POLICY (MANDATORY)

| Layer | Language | Examples |
|-------|----------|----------|
| Source code | **English** | Class/method/variable names, JavaDoc, inline comments |
| API user messages | **Vietnamese** | `BusinessException`, `AttendanceLockedException`, validation messages |
| Frontend UI/UX | **Vietnamese** | Labels, buttons, badges, modals, toasts, empty states |
| Dev docs (README) | **Vietnamese** | Setup guides for the team |
| This file | **English** | AI coding conventions |

**Never** mix Vietnamese in Java/React identifiers or English in end-user-facing text.

---

## 2. TECH STACK & LOCAL ENV

- **Backend:** Spring Boot 3.x, Spring Security, Spring Data JPA, Java 17
- **Frontend:** React 18, Vite, Tailwind CSS
- **Database:** MySQL 8.0 on `localhost:3306` (shared instance with survey app `fm_db_bv87`)
- **Attendance DB:** `diemdanhngay_bv87_db` (separate database, same MySQL server)
- **Secrets:** `backend/local-secrets.yml` (gitignored) — never commit passwords
- **Schema:** Hibernate `ddl-auto: update` + `schema.sql` / `data.sql` on startup
- **API port (local):** 8082 · **Frontend:** 5173

---

## 3. DATA MODEL RULES

- `dept_code`, `emp_code`: **INT / Integer** in DB and entities (index-friendly)
- Display padding at application layer only:
  - Backend: `CodeFormatter.formatDeptCode()` → `%02d`, `formatEmpCode()` → `%05d`
  - Frontend: `padStart(2,'0')`, `padStart(5,'0')`
- Do not store padded strings in the database

---

## 4. ENUM STANDARDS (MANDATORY)

Use enums instead of magic strings for domain states. Every enum must:

1. Live under `entity` or `enums` package
2. Have a short class-level JavaDoc explaining its purpose
3. Expose `getLabel()` returning **Vietnamese** text when shown to users
4. Be used in `switch` / `if` checks — never compare raw string literals in business logic

Current enums:
- `AttendanceStatus` — DI_LAM, NGHI_PHEP, DI_TRE, DI_HOC, DI_CONG_TAC
- `AccountRole` — ADMIN, HEAD

---

## 5. CODE COMMENT STANDARDS

### Java (Backend)
- **Class:** one-line purpose JavaDoc
- **Public service methods:** JavaDoc with `@param`, `@return`, `@throws` in English
- **Non-obvious business rules:** brief inline comment in English
- **No** commented-out code blocks; **no** Vietnamese in code comments

### React (Frontend)
- UI label maps live in `src/constants/` (Vietnamese values)
- Component props: JSDoc only when behaviour is non-obvious
- No Vietnamese in function/variable names

---

## 6. BUSINESS WORKFLOW

### 7 departments (dept_code 1–7)
01 Ban Giám đốc · 02 Kế hoạch-Tổng hợp · 03 Chính trị · 04 Hậu cần-Kỹ thuật · 05 Tham mưu-Hành chính · 06 Điều dưỡng · 07 Ban Tài chính

### Daily attendance window
- **06:00–16:00** (Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh): HEAD can edit own department
- **After 16:00:** locked for HEAD → read-only UI; API returns HTTP 403 (Vietnamese message)
- **Admin unlock:** `POST /api/attendance/unlock` with mandatory `reason` → `attendance_unlocks`

### Roles
- **ADMIN:** all departments, unlock, full dashboard
- **HEAD:** own department only

---

## 7. ARCHITECTURE

```
Controller  → validate input, map HTTP
Service     → business logic, lock checks, authorization
Repository  → JPA queries
DTO         → API response; include *Formatted fields for padded codes
Entity      → DB mapping only
```

---

## 8. FRONTEND UI COLOR TOKENS (MANDATORY)

All React components must use **Tailwind semantic tokens** from `frontend/tailwind.config.js`.
Reference map: `frontend/src/constants/theme.js`. **Never** hardcode hex in JSX.

### Brand (Light Mode — mockup)
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| `primary` | `#2563EB` | Progress card, active date pill, links, focus ring |
| `primary-hover` | `#1D4ED8` | Primary button hover |
| `primary-light` | `#EFF6FF` | Sidebar active bg, info surfaces |
| `navy` | `#001A4D` | Page titles, CTA "Gửi báo cáo", pagination active |
| `navy-soft` | `#2A3F75` | Secondary navy hover |

### Surfaces & borders
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| `surface-page` | `#F8F9FA` | Main content background |
| `surface-white` | `#FFFFFF` | Cards, table rows |
| `line` | `#E0E0E0` | Borders, dividers |
| `content-muted` | `#6C757D` | Secondary text |

### Semantic status (badges & quick buttons)
| Token | Background | Foreground | Maps to |
|-------|------------|------------|---------|
| `success` | `#DEFBE8` | `#10B981` | Có mặt / Đi làm |
| `warning` | `#FFFBEB` | `#F59E0B` | Đi trễ |
| `danger` | `#FEF2F2` | `#EF4444` | Vắng / Nghỉ phép |
| `info` | `#EFF6FF` | `#3B82F6` | Đi học / Công tác / job tag |
| `neutral` | `#F3F4F6` | `#6B7280` | Chưa chấm |

### Admin portal (ADMIN role only)
- Frontend: `components/admin/AdminApp.jsx` — lazy-loaded tabs Departments / Staff
- API base: `/api/admin/*` (relative paths, session cookie)
- Codes: INT in DB; display with `CodeFormatter` / `padStart` — never strip leading zeros in UI

### CSS component classes (`index.css`)
- Badges: `badge-success`, `badge-warning`, `badge-danger`, `badge-info`, `badge-neutral`
- Buttons: `btn-primary` (blue), `btn-navy` (dark CTA)
- Do not use Tailwind default `green-500`, `red-600`, etc. in attendance UI

